Changes: native macOS launcher, independent device sessions, Android virtual
hardware keys, text input, edge margins and per-device logcat recording;
account-free AVFoundation USB viewing; native USB forwarding and signing service;
WebDriverAgent-based iOS device/simulator clicks, touch trajectories, holds,
text and navigation buttons.
The packaged WDA source imports the Apache-2.0 Device Mirror DMControlCommands extension
from FBTouchActionCommands.m; upstream BSD headers and license are retained.
The fixed upstream submodule is unchanged.
Project documentation and native UI guidance are maintained for Device Mirror.
Upstream command-line documentation and release scripts are omitted from this
macOS app distribution; the original source history remains available in Git.
Modified upstream files carry Device Mirror comments; new files carry SPDX notices.

WebDriverAgent: Copyright (c) 2015-present, Facebook, Inc. All rights reserved.
Its full BSD license is retained in third_party/WebDriverAgent/LICENSE and the app.
The bundled icon is the original scrcpy icon, not an original Device Mirror logo.
Android adb is built from nmeum/android-tools 37.0.0p1 and its vendored
AOSP/BoringSSL/fmt sources. The header search order is adjusted for macOS;
mDNS is disabled. LGPL libusb 1.0.30 is built as a replaceable shared library.
Complete source archives, build script, dependency notices and version records
are bundled in ThirdParty/Android-tools/.
